"],["ARC or PLC in Texas County","/arc-plc/missouri/texas-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 166% of normal in April to May and only 43% in November to December. Grid 20854 had its driest year in 1953, at 48% of normal.</p>"}
